52539550458,"text":"5 At university, Alex wants to","x":0.087145976256668048,"y":0.82847626957900433,"w":0.23093681335449218},{"text":"in law, but","y":0.82975169271273608,"h":0.010554754366783325,"w":0.089420785903930711,"x":0.40518067493896692},{"y":0.84302325592485516,"w":0.25925924301147463,"h":0.011681156888988742,"text":"he wants to study a language too.","x":0.10893246582178641},{"x":0.087145976970424754,"w":0.36601306915283205,"text":"6 largued with my sister and then found it hard","y":0.85755813974268447,"h":0.011717464008696554},{"h":0.0072674413803316407,"y":0.87354651182255216,"x":0.11111111132292695,"w":0.017429193258285514,"text":"to"},{"text":"_ down to study. I couldn't concentrate.","y":0.87209302353144424,"h":0.011753770731370961,"x":0.22004357873085034,"w":0.29411764144897456},{"text":"TIPS","w":0.11377123832702629,"x":0.85161111337897555,"h":0.025703574695952414,"y":0.26403774746760589},{"y":0.29505813965610939,"x":0.6601307231471043,"w":0.30501089096069334,"text":"FOR SUCCESSFUL STUDY","h":0.013081394961037107},{"h":0.014534882760663392,"text":"• Have a long-term plan. What do you want to go into","y":0.32412790721462958,"w":0.39651412963867194,"x":0.55555556495553715},{"h":0.011815492358434043,"text":"after you finish your studies? Working towards a goal can","y":0.34138218170702095,"x":0.55555557558581314,"w":0.41394332885742191},{"h":0.014609151835445644,"text":"inspire you to work hard now.","x":0.55539423690312328,"y":0.3545575316150178,"w":0.22039670944213874},{"text":"• Motivate yourself. If you find it hard to 1","x":0.55754389617816258,"y":0.37055559810257588,"w":0.30981603622436527,"h":0.016345180540060955},{"x":0.55773422340372447,"text":"and study at home, then give yourself a treat after you finish.","w":0.41176467895507818,"h":0.011699310448842648,"y":0.38800999153570148},{"y":0.40116279067355121,"h":0.013081394961037107,"w":0.41176467895507818,"x":0.55773421146654256,"text":"For example, listening to music or having a hot chocola